# Connections per ASCII schematic:
# USB-C VBUS -> TP4056 IN
# TP4056 IN -> LiPo BAT+ (via TP4056) and BAT- to LiPo-
# LiPo BAT+ -> Schottky diode anode
# Schottky diode cathode -> MCP1700-33 (LDO) input
# MCP1700-33 output -> ESP32-C3 VIN and 3.3V rail
# ESP32-C3 GPIOs 7-14 -> 220Ω resistors -> display segments a,b,c,d,e,f,g,dp (via 8x220Ω)
# ESP32-C3 GPIOs 0,2,4,5 -> 4.7kΩ resistors -> NPN transistor bases (2N2222) for digit drivers
# NPN collectors -> display digit commons (via digit enable pins)
# NPN emitters -> GND
# ESP32-C3 GPIO1 -> Tactile Switch SW1 (other side to GND)
# ESP32-C3 GPIO3 -> Tactile Switch SW2 (other side to GND)
# ESP32-C3 GPIO6 -> LDR (one side); other side of LDR to 3.3V via? Actually LDR: one side to 3.3V, other side to GPIO6 plus 10k pull-down to GND.
# ESP32-C3 GPIO16 -> 220Ω -> LED_R anode
# ESP32-C3 GPIO17 -> 220Ω -> LED_G anode
# ESP32-C3 GPIO18 -> 220Ω -> LED_B anode
# RGB LED common cathode -> GND
# Optional KY-040 encoder: CLK GPIO19, DT GPIO20, SW GPIO21 (with pull-ups)
# 10kΩ resistors R9-R12: pull-ups for buttons? (firmware uses INPUT_PULLUP, external optional)
Wire Wire Line
0 0 0 0
Text Label 0 0 0 50 ~ 0 VBUS
Wire Wire Line
0 0 0 0
Text Label 0 0 0 50 ~ 0 GND
#End NETLIST
$EndSCHEMATC